00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:53.440
The Guinness Book of World Records estimates that more than five billion copies of the Bible have
《吉尼斯世界纪录大全》估计《圣经》的销量已经超过了五十亿册，

440
00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.040
been sold.
