473
00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:19.180
I was very curious what was in the shooting draft about Michael's book, if there was more.
我很好奇拍摄剧本里关于迈克尔的书是怎么写的，是不是还有更多内容。

474
00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:19.660
Oh.
哦。

475
00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:23.920
Because he just pauses and looks off into the distance, right?
因为他只是停顿了一下，然后望向远方，对吧？

476
00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.340
And then it cuts away.
然后镜头就切走了。

477
00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:26.600
And I was like, was there more?
我就在想，还有更多内容吗？

478
00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.920
Here's how this moment read in the shooting draft.
拍摄剧本里这一刻是这样写的。

479
00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:33.740
Michael, you know, is talking into the recorder.
迈克尔，你知道的，正在对着录音机说话。

480
00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:34.300
Yeah.
是啊。

481
00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:37.740
He says, The Fundamentals of Business by Michael Scott.
他说，《商业基础》，作者迈克尔·斯科特。

482
00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.960
There is a long beat.
停顿了很久。

483
00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.240
Chapter one.
第一章。

484
00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:47.600
The murderer walked into the garden worriedly, not happily.
凶手忧心忡忡地走进花园，并不开心。

485
00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:50.200
It was the happiest day of his life.
这是他一生中最快乐的一天。

486
00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:51.900
He was going to space.
他要去太空了。

487
00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:52.980
What?
什么？

488
00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:54.640
Long beat.
长停顿。

489
00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:56.720
Chapter two.
第二章。

490
00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:02.360
We laugh.
我们笑了。

491
00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.400
I'm sure they did a whole bunch of alts, right?
我敢肯定他们拍了很多备选方案，对吧？

492
00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.680
I bet there was a bunch of candy bags for this one.
我打赌这一段肯定有很多即兴发挥。

493
00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:08.760
But that's what was in the shooting draft.
但拍摄剧本里写的就是这些。

494
00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:12.000
Well, now we're going to get into the meat of this episode.
好了，现在我们要进入这一集的重点了。

495
00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:18.120
Michael arrives to work, and there's a man sitting on the reception couch, waiting to
迈克尔来到公司，有个男人坐在前台的沙发上，等着

496
00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:18.700
see him.
见他。

497
00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:20.780
Aaron has allowed this.
亚伦允许他这么做。

498
00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:22.040
Michael's not pleased.
迈克尔很不高兴。

499
00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:23.520
Michael is so bombed.
迈克尔气炸了。

500
00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:26.520
He's like, you have to protect my creative space.
他觉得，你得保护我的创作空间。

501
00:22:26.980 --> 00:22:27.420
Yeah.
是啊。

502
00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:31.480
I mean, she was like, well, I thought this could be part of your creative space.
我是说，她说，嗯，我觉得这可以作为你的创意空间的一部分。

503
00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:35.240
And he's like, just push creative space to the afternoon.
然后他说，把创意空间推迟到下午吧。

504
00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:36.980
What did I have?
我当时有什么安排？

505
00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.340
And she's like, free play.
她说，自由活动。

506
00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:40.080
He's like, push free play to tomorrow.
他说，把自由活动推迟到明天。

507
00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:42.160
What is his schedule?
他的日程表到底是怎么排的？

508
00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:43.060
I don't know.
我不知道。

509
00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:48.060
Well, this insurance salesman, Mr. Grotty, begins a presentation.
嗯，这位保险推销员，格罗蒂先生，开始了他的演示。

510
00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:49.240
Michael's so bored.
迈克尔觉得无聊透顶。

511
00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:53.180
He has a talking head where he says there's nothing more insulting than listening to a bad
他有一个面对镜头的独白，说没有什么比听一个糟糕的推销员说话更侮辱人的了，

512
00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:57.700
salesman, is like a good basketball player listening to a bad basketball player.
就像一个优秀的篮球运动员在听一个糟糕的篮球运动员说话一样。

513
00:22:58.420 --> 00:23:05.320
And right after this talking head would have been a pretty important deleted scene for the
就在这段独白之后，本来有一段对帕姆水彩画闹剧来说非常重要的删减片段。

514
00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:07.280
Pam watercolor fiasco.
哦。

515
00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:08.140
Oh.
场景是在亚伦、斯坦利和梅雷迪思之间。

516
00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:11.180
It's between Aaron, Stanley, and Meredith.
在厨房里。

517
00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:12.240
It's in the kitchen.
感觉亚伦有点在挑拨离间，好像她对帕姆休了这么久的蜜月假心怀不满。

518
00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:18.480
And it kind of feels like Aaron is stirring the pot a little, like she has some resentment
嗯。

519
00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.620
to how long Pam has been on her honeymoon vacation.
但你猜是谁帮帕姆反击的？

520
00:23:23.400 --> 00:23:23.680
Hmm.
你绝对想不到。

521
00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:25.920
But guess who gets her back?
说来听听。

522
00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:27.120
You'll never believe it.
伙计，吉姆和帕姆是不是已经走了好久了？

523
00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.000
Let's hear it.
谁在乎啊？

524
00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:31.140
Man, doesn't it seem like Jim and Pam have been gone forever?
哦，我只是随口说说，她能有这么多假真是太好了。

525
00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:32.700
Who gives a crap?
这很不寻常。

526
00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:35.960
Oh, I'm just saying, it's great that she has so much time off.
你是想让她惹麻烦吗？

527
00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:36.780
It's unusual.
完全没有。

528
00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:38.760
Are you trying to get her in trouble?
她完全有资格休蜜月假。

529
00:23:38.760 --> 00:23:39.860
Not at all.
我想之后还有她的产假。

530
00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:42.160
She totally deserves time off for her honeymoon.
老师，老师，帕姆这周没来上课。

531
00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:44.720
And then I guess for her maternity leave after that.
背后捅刀一个孕妇。

532
00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:48.480
Teacher, teacher, Pam hasn't been in class this week.
不，我只是在找话题聊天。

533
00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:50.440
Backstabbing a pregnant woman.
我们可以聊任何事。

534
00:23:50.920 --> 00:23:52.040
No, I'm just making conversation.
梅雷迪思，我在桥上看到你儿子的涂鸦了。

535
00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:53.560
We can talk about anything.
哇，他喷漆喷得真棒。

536
00:23:54.720 --> 00:23:56.760
Meredith, I saw your son's tag on the bridge.
听着，你永远成不了帕姆。

537
00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.340
Wow, he's so great with a spray can.
我们永远会更喜欢她。

538
00:23:59.940 --> 00:24:01.580
Look, you're never going to be Pam.
认清现实吧。

539
00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:03.200
We're always going to like her more.
什么？

540
00:24:03.940 --> 00:24:04.480
Deal with it.
天哪！

541
00:24:05.580 --> 00:24:06.020
What?
他们俩都算是站在我这边。

542
00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.100
Oh my gosh!
确实！

543
00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:10.060
They kind of both have my back.
我是说，斯坦利说你在背后捅刀一个孕妇。

544
00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:10.860
They do!
然后梅雷迪思当然就说，我们永远会更喜欢她。

545
00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:14.240
I mean, Stanley's like your backstabbing a pregnant woman.
之后本来还有一场戏，托比在前台找到亚伦，

546
00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:17.620
And then Meredith, of course, is like, we're always going to like her more.
说，嘿，你真的不应该议论别人的休假，你知道吗？

547
00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:22.680
This would have gone on to another scene where Toby approaches Aaron at front reception
嗯。

548
00:24:22.680 --> 00:24:28.560
and says, hey, you really shouldn't be talking about people's time off from work, you know?
然后她说，我什么都没说。

549
00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:29.520
Hmm.
是啊。

550
00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:31.820
And she's like, I didn't say anything.
是啊。

551
00:24:31.960 --> 00:24:33.100
I like Pam.
我喜欢帕姆。

552
00:24:33.100 --> 00:24:37.060
Pam, and then Toby's like, Aaron, and is like really stern with her.
帕姆，然后托比就像是，亚伦，对她非常严厉。

553
00:24:37.680 --> 00:24:42.760
And all of those little moments led up to her then trying to prove to everyone she really
所有这些小细节都铺垫了她后来试图向大家证明她真的

554
00:24:42.760 --> 00:24:43.380
likes Pam.
喜欢帕姆。

555
00:24:43.520 --> 00:24:44.780
She's going to clean her painting.
她要去清理那幅画。

556
00:24:45.940 --> 00:24:46.420
Wow.
哇。

557
00:24:46.880 --> 00:24:48.380
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

558
00:24:48.660 --> 00:24:50.600
See, now I did not remember that stuff.
你看，我都不记得这些事了。

559
00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:56.000
I just remember, I obviously was very focused on the destruction part.
我只记得，我当时显然非常关注破坏的部分。

560
00:24:56.340 --> 00:24:58.180
I didn't get into the motivation part.
我没去深究动机的部分。

561
00:24:58.380 --> 00:24:59.120
That's right.
没错。

562
00:24:59.500 --> 00:25:03.540
I'm still glad it's all gone because it also makes Aaron seem petty.
我还是很高兴它被毁了，因为这让亚伦看起来很小气。

563
00:25:03.680 --> 00:25:06.500
And I just, I think it was the right choice.
而且我只是，我觉得这是正确的选择。

564
00:25:06.720 --> 00:25:07.960
I'm glad you fought for it.
很高兴你坚持要这么做。

565
00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:09.220
Yeah, I agree.
是的，我同意。

566
00:25:09.220 --> 00:25:14.060
It feels a little out of character for Aaron to be, you know, stirring the pot.
亚伦去挑拨离间，感觉有点不像他的性格。

567
00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:14.820
Yeah.
是啊。

568
00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:19.260
Well, after this, there's a scene in accounting that sets up a very funny storyline.
嗯，在这之后，会计部有一个场景引出了一个非常有趣的剧情。

569
00:25:19.260 --> 00:25:20.900
There was actually more to it.
其实还有更多内容。

570
00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:22.820
Oscar and Angela are working.
奥斯卡和安吉拉正在工作。

571
00:25:23.060 --> 00:25:24.380
Kevin's phone won't stop ringing.
凯文的电话响个不停。

572
00:25:24.700 --> 00:25:27.200
They both are looking over at him in Jim's office.
他们俩都在看着吉姆办公室里的他。

573
00:25:27.420 --> 00:25:29.840
He's like eating M&Ms with his feet up on the desk.
他正吃着M&M豆，脚还翘在桌子上。

574
00:25:30.380 --> 00:25:33.000
Angela is staring daggers at him.
安吉拉正怒目圆睁地盯着他。

575
00:25:33.120 --> 00:25:37.160
And Oscar says to her, you could have had Jim's office if you thought of it.
奥斯卡对她说，如果你想到了，你也能坐进吉姆的办公室。

576
00:25:37.300 --> 00:25:39.060
And Angela says, I did think of it.
安吉拉说，我确实想到了。

577
00:25:39.140 --> 00:25:40.500
I just didn't act on it.
我只是没付诸行动。

578
00:25:40.740 --> 00:25:44.440
And then we cut to Kevin's talking head.
然后镜头切到了凯文的采访画面。

579
00:25:44.440 --> 00:25:46.960
That explains why he's in Jim's office.
这就解释了他为什么在吉姆的办公室里。

580
00:25:46.960 --> 00:25:48.740
It's because he went in there to fart.
因为他是进去放屁的。

581
00:25:49.600 --> 00:25:49.780
Yeah.
是啊。

582
00:25:50.180 --> 00:25:53.140
Which I have to imagine Angela is grateful for.
我想安吉拉对此应该很庆幸。

583
00:25:53.780 --> 00:25:55.220
Well, there's that.
嗯，确实如此。

584
00:25:55.720 --> 00:25:56.280
You know.
你知道的。

585
00:25:56.480 --> 00:25:56.680
There is that.
确实如此。

586
00:25:57.340 --> 00:26:01.520
During Kevin's talking head at three minutes, five seconds, I caught something, Jenna.
在三分零五秒凯文的采访画面里，我发现了一个细节，珍娜。

587
00:26:01.780 --> 00:26:02.480
What's that?
什么细节？

588
00:26:02.680 --> 00:26:04.940
I got so excited about this moment.
我当时太激动了。

589
00:26:04.940 --> 00:26:07.960
I let out a yell and Josh was in the kitchen.
我大叫了一声，当时乔什在厨房。

590
00:26:07.960 --> 00:26:10.680
I was in our family room and he was like, what's going on?
我在家庭室，他问我，怎么了？

591
00:26:10.680 --> 00:26:13.900
And I'm like, it's Kevin Malone's desk plate.
我说，是凯文·马龙的桌牌。

592
00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:15.340
His name desk plate.
他的名字桌牌。

593
00:26:15.580 --> 00:26:17.680
Yeah, that we talked with Brian about.
对，就是我们和布莱恩聊过的那个。

594
00:26:17.840 --> 00:26:18.800
I saw it too.
我也看到了。

595
00:26:19.300 --> 00:26:24.180
This would have been the only time anyone would have seen it because it was facing out.
这应该是唯一一次有人能看到它，因为它当时是朝外的。

596
00:26:25.020 --> 00:26:25.540
Yeah.
是的。

597
00:26:25.780 --> 00:26:27.380
He put it the right way.
他把它摆对了方向。

598
00:26:27.580 --> 00:26:29.080
He put it the right way.
他把它摆对了方向。

599
00:26:29.560 --> 00:26:31.880
In accounting, it always just faced himself.
在会计部，它总是只对着他自己。

600
00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:36.060
I noticed a few other things that Kevin brought to Jim's desk.
我还注意到凯文带到吉姆桌上的其他几样东西。

601
00:26:36.500 --> 00:26:43.040
He brought a Coney Island mug, his M&Ms, of course, and an arena football.
他带了一个康尼岛的马克杯，当然还有他的M&M巧克力豆，以及一个室内橄榄球。

602
00:26:43.680 --> 00:26:45.640
I thought that was so interesting.
我觉得这太有意思了。

603
00:26:45.640 --> 00:26:48.380
I don't think those things are normally in Jim's office.
我觉得这些东西平时不应该在吉姆的办公室里。

604
00:26:48.880 --> 00:26:50.820
No, he's clearly moved in.
没错，他显然已经搬进去了。

605
00:26:51.020 --> 00:26:53.640
It's hilarious to me that Michael never said, what are you doing?
迈克尔居然从来没问过“你在干什么？”，这让我觉得太搞笑了。

606
00:26:54.140 --> 00:26:55.740
Why are you in Jim's office?
你为什么在吉姆的办公室里？

607
00:26:55.740 --> 00:27:01.520
In the shooting draft, it called for a lot of B-roll footage of Kevin in Jim's office.
在拍摄剧本里，要求拍摄大量凯文在吉姆办公室里的空镜素材。

608
00:27:01.780 --> 00:27:05.240
And there was a whole bunch here that they filmed that we didn't see.
这里拍了很多我们没看到的镜头。

609
00:27:05.380 --> 00:27:06.220
I'm going to read it to you.
我要读给你们听。

610
00:27:07.060 --> 00:27:08.440
He's sitting at his desk.
他坐在办公桌前。

611
00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:09.580
He starts flossing.
他开始用牙线剔牙。

612
00:27:10.100 --> 00:27:13.940
He yawns, then falls asleep with the floss in his mouth.
他打了个哈欠，然后嘴里含着牙线睡着了。

613
00:27:14.580 --> 00:27:16.520
He's also wearing his toupee.
他还戴着他的假发。

614
00:27:17.500 --> 00:27:22.920
Later that day, Kevin is napping with his shirt off, scrunched up under his head like a pillow.
那天晚些时候，凯文脱了衬衫在打盹，把衬衫揉成一团垫在头下当枕头。

615
00:27:22.920 --> 00:27:26.080
He has pulled his toupee across his eyes.
他把假发拉下来遮住了眼睛。

616
00:27:28.210 --> 00:27:30.470
This is like, he lives there now.
这简直就像是他现在住在那儿一样。

617
00:27:30.710 --> 00:27:31.370
He does.
确实是。

618
00:27:31.670 --> 00:27:32.890
There was so much B-roll.
空镜素材实在太多了。

619
00:27:33.310 --> 00:27:35.690
Well, he says he likes it better than his own home.
嗯，他说他比待在自己家里更喜欢这里。

620
00:27:36.050 --> 00:27:36.790
He does.
他确实喜欢。

621
00:27:37.390 --> 00:27:41.650
Well, Andy and Dwight are watching this meeting go down in the conference room,
安迪和德怀特正在会议室里看着这场会议进行，

622
00:27:41.650 --> 00:27:46.470
and they have decided that the insurance salesman is a mobster.
他们认定那个保险推销员是个黑手党。

623
00:27:47.350 --> 00:27:52.550
Oscar is kind of like, guys, guys, not all Italian Americans are in the mafia.
奥斯卡大概是想说，伙计们，伙计们，并不是所有意大利裔美国人都是黑手党。

624
00:27:52.550 --> 00:27:59.190
This scene would have continued, but it was deleted, where Oscar looks around the office for support.
这场戏本该继续，但被删减了，奥斯卡在办公室里环顾四周寻求支持。

625
00:27:59.430 --> 00:28:02.010
He says, who else is here right now?
他说，现在还有谁在这儿？

626
00:28:02.170 --> 00:28:02.690
Angela?
安吉拉？

627
00:28:03.070 --> 00:28:05.330
And Angela says, I didn't see anything.
安吉拉说，我什么都没看见。

628
00:28:05.330 --> 00:28:06.650
I'm not getting involved.
我不想卷入其中。

629
00:28:06.930 --> 00:28:08.330
Oscar's like, where's Toby?
奥斯卡问，托比在哪儿？

630
00:28:08.670 --> 00:28:11.670
He's desperately looking for anyone with a voice of reason.
他拼命地寻找任何一个能讲道理的人。

631
