so well and why he believes it endures.
这么好，以及为什么他认为它经久不衰。

1383
01:04:37.500 --> 01:04:42.420
I think the Office episode Mafia is an original contribution to the history of comedy because
我认为《办公室》的这一集《黑手党》是对喜剧史的原创贡献，因为

1384
01:04:42.420 --> 01:04:46.060
there is a real story and there's a fake story.
这里有一个真实的故事，还有一个虚构的故事。

1385
01:04:46.240 --> 01:04:50.120
And all of the stakes for the characters happen in the fake story.
而角色们的所有赌注都发生在虚构的故事里。

1386
01:04:50.280 --> 01:04:54.540
But the actors grounded and played so real that we actually feel stakes for them, and we
但演员们演得非常扎实真实，以至于我们真的为他们感到揪心，并且

1387
01:04:54.540 --> 01:04:57.320
actually feel their emotional resolution at the end.
我们真的感受到了他们最后的情感解脱。

1388
01:04:57.480 --> 01:05:02.920
It also has an incredibly original ending where Dwight and Andy fake Michael into believing
它还有一个极其原创的结局，德怀特和安迪欺骗迈克尔让他相信

1389
01:05:02.920 --> 01:05:03.440
the truth.
真相。

1390
01:05:03.680 --> 01:05:08.820
And this, quote, false understanding of reality is what allows Michael to solve his problems
而这种所谓的“虚假现实认知”正是让迈克尔解决他在

1391
01:05:08.820 --> 01:05:09.840
in the fake story.
虚构故事中问题的原因。

1392
01:05:09.840 --> 01:05:11.080
It's highly original.
这非常有创意。

1393
01:05:11.240 --> 01:05:15.980
And I think those scenes of Andy, Dwight, and Michael in Michael's office will stand the
我认为安迪、德怀特和迈克尔在迈克尔办公室里的那些场景将永远经受住

1394
01:05:15.980 --> 01:05:18.700
test of time with comedy nerds forever.
喜剧迷们的考验。

1395
01:05:20.400 --> 01:05:22.880
Well, it stood the test of time for me.
嗯，它经受住了我的考验。

1396
01:05:23.660 --> 01:05:25.800
I loved the complexity of it.
我喜欢它的复杂性。

1397
01:05:25.920 --> 01:05:26.860
For sure.
确实。

1398
01:05:27.400 --> 01:05:32.740
And, you know, a little piece of Mr. Grotty is going to stay with Michael now forever.
而且，你知道，格罗蒂先生的一点点影子现在将永远留在迈克尔心中。

1399
01:05:33.240 --> 01:05:33.720
Oh, yeah.
噢，是的。

