01:05:37.780 --> 01:05:38.480
Not from the kitchen.
不要厨房里的那种。

1403
01:05:38.560 --> 01:05:39.500
The stop and shop.
要Stop and Shop买的。

1404
01:05:39.620 --> 01:05:41.520
If it's not the stop and shop, I send it back.
如果不是Stop and Shop买的，我就退回去。

1405
01:05:41.880 --> 01:05:42.280
Large.
大杯的。

1406
01:05:42.280 --> 01:05:43.740
If it's a medium, I send it back.
如果是中杯的，我就退回去。

1407
01:05:43.880 --> 01:05:45.760
If it's an extra large, I send it back.
如果是超大杯的，我也退回去。

1408
01:05:46.580 --> 01:05:50.540
So there is part of Michael and Mr. Grotty that are always going to be together.
所以迈克尔和格罗蒂先生之间总会有某种联系。

1409
